<!--Post: 9901--><!--Time: 1109698023-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9901"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 9:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was just informed by my family, that they have opened up Jacksonville &amp; Independence! As I stated before there are No Tresspassing signs posted. For all of you curious George&#39;s what do you expect to see?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9901-->
<!--Post: 9937--><!--Time: 1109709262-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9937"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:crazyhorse4440@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lola<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lola<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 12:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky~ Can you be more specific?  <BR> <BR>.....that they have opened up Jacksonville &amp; Independence! As I stated before there are No Tresspassing signs posted. For all of you curious George&#39;s what do you expect to see? <BR> <BR>What exactly are you talking about? <BR>Thanks in advance~<!--/Text--></td></tr>
